> Tina_H...@kruemel.org (Tina Hall) wrote:

>> More spoily questions (this time about changing alignment).



>> I am wondering what it was again that one had to do to convert to
>> another god (not before the Quest, I do remember that).

[...]
>> And wasn't there something about same-race sacrifice turning an
>> altar to chaotic in any case?
>>
>> (I think I'd much rather have a chaotic knight, if I ever find a
